# The forest wolf's body (#331, D101, D115): the `dead` frame of wolf.grid, pixel for pixel, on its side. Since #571 (D117,
# the author, 2026-11-21) it keeps the live wolf's palette, ink contour and moon rim (from above, as the wolf), exactly as the
# `dead` frame: no decor recolour, no tint, no halo. The pose on its side is the cue that it is dead (RemainsTest).
# Keep it in step with wolf.grid: same keys, same colours.
size 48 24
color k 0b0814
color d 2a0612
color a 4a0c22
color b 86101f
color c 9c2050
color m b85a80
color p c87896
color l 9a6070
color L b07c8c
color e ff6b57
color f e8e0cc
frame body
